From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chuanchuan <example@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:36:25 +0800
Subject: feat: carry proxy username and password on ProxyServer

Accept userinfo in proxy rules and use it for HTTP proxy 407 and SOCKS5 RFC 1929 authentication. Omit credentials from PAC strings and pickles.

This is Electron-specific and cannot be upstreamed.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

